DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260730T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260730T140000
SUMMARY:TxDOT - Texas Triangle Multimodal Strategic Plan Webinar
LOCATION:Virtual (Microsoft Teams)
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/projects-studies/statewide/ttmsp.html
DESCRIPTION:Virtual webinar\, 12pm CDT. Registration required - a Teams inv
 itation is\nsent to the address you register with:\nhttps://forms.office.c
 om/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=dqTbOQlcY0yR2s56OrUiTehB7aaighdMu7NupziNqitU
 OFlWMzRRMU9EWjgyWTUxWEswWFMzQ08yWC4u\n\nTxDOT is seeking input from transp
 ortation and mobility advocates on the\nTexas Triangle Multimodal Strategi
 c Plan - current transportation\nchallenges\, emerging mobility trends\, a
 nd connections between communities\nacross the Dallas-Fort Worth / Houston
  / San Antonio / Austin mega-region.\n
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
