UID:txdotev-txdot-i-14-extension-public-meeting-temple-20260805T1700@calend
 ars.changesaroundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260729T024814Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260805T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260805T190000
SUMMARY:TxDOT - I-14 Extension Public Meeting (Temple)
LOCATION:Frank W. Mayborn Civic & Convention Center\, Main Hall\, 3303 N. 3
 rd Street\, Temple\, TX 76501
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/waco/2026/i14-extensio
 n-080526.html
DESCRIPTION:Open house\, drop in any time 5-7pm CDT. One of two in-person m
 eetings on\nthe same proposals\; the other is in Belton on 6 Aug 2026.\n\n
 Proposed I-35 improvements from south of Loop 121 in Belton to Loop\n363/U
 S 190/SH 36 in Temple ("Segment 1")\, part of extending I-14 from its\ncur
 rent terminus in Belton to BU 190 in Rogers.\n\nA pre-recorded video of th
 e same presentation goes up on the project page\nby 5pm on 5 Aug 2026. Wri
 tten comments must be postmarked or received by\n21 Aug 2026 to enter the 
 official record.\n
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:txdotev-txdot-i-14-extension-public-meeting-belton-20260806T1700@calend
 ars.changesaroundme.com
DTSTAMP:20260729T024814Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260806T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260806T190000
SUMMARY:TxDOT - I-14 Extension Public Meeting (Belton)
LOCATION:Huntington Bank Expo (Cadence Bank Center)\, Assembly Hall\, 301 W
 . Loop 121\, Belton\, TX 76513
URL:https://www.txdot.gov/projects/hearings-meetings/waco/2026/i14-extensio
 n-080526.html
DESCRIPTION:Open house\, drop in any time 5-7pm CDT. Same proposals as the 
 Temple\nmeeting on 5 Aug 2026 - attend whichever is more convenient.\n\nPr
 oposed I-35 improvements from south of Loop 121 in Belton to Loop\n363/US 
 190/SH 36 in Temple ("Segment 1")\, part of extending I-14 from its\ncurre
 nt terminus in Belton to BU 190 in Rogers.\n\nWritten comments must be pos
 tmarked or received by 21 Aug 2026 to enter\nthe official record.\n
CATEGORIES:engagement
X-CAM-ORG:txdotev
END:VEVENT
